<title>USA: Seattle $55 mln water bonds won by Bear Stearns.</title>
<headline>Seattle $55 mln water bonds won by Bear Stearns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co. said Tuesday it won $55 million Seattle water system revenue bonds at a true interest cost of 5.711 percent.</p>
</text>
